{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HGifQ9nzUxwMfCfxLDSSB6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 SOS cards are implemented and tested. Final results:\n\n- **166 SOS card tests pass** across all 10 cards (1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257).\n- **1350 total tests pass** (SOS + engine_tests + FDN) — no regressions.\n\nThe last card, **Great Hall of the Biblioplex** (sos_257), is a manland implemented as a `Land` with:\n- `{T}: Add {C}` and `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add any color` mana abilities\n- `{5}` activated ability that animates it into a 2/4 Wizard via `animate()`, which adds the creature type, sets P/T, and registers a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` (+1/+0 per instant/sorcery cast) plus an `EndStepTriggeredEvent` to reset the pump.\n\nIts 27 tests cover land properties, both mana abilities (incl. life payment, tapped/zero-life failures, color-choice fallback), the `{5}` cost/animate path, trigger registration/idempotency, the cast-pump (controller-only, instant/sorcery-only), and end-step reset.\n\nEngine changes made this session were all additive (no renames/moves/deletes): `skipped_turns` skip logic in `game_state.py`, `flip_coin` in `game.py`, the `cards_drawn_this_turn` reset and end-step/end-of-turn event firing in `turn.py`. The `engine_tests/` and FDN tests were left untouched and still pass. All tasks are complete."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":69262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1995741a-49a1-4a45-a041-801f56ba31a7","uuid":"f2a9483f-e943-4728-8f62-59c4052eddb8","request_id":"req_011Cbe3Yxm4qV6wBrWz23SYd"}
